### Cadastro com dados validos (sucesso 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Maria",
    "email": "maria@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Cadastro sem nome (erro 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "alberico@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Cadastro com email inválido (erro 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alberico",
    "email": "albericoexample.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Cadastro com senha curta (erro 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register        
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alberico",
    "email": "alberico@example.com",
    "password": "123"
}

###Cadastro com senha com números (erro 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alberico",
    "email": "alberico@example.com",
    "password": 123456
}

###Login sem senha (erro 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "maria@example.com"
}

###Login valido
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "maria@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

###Login com senha incorreta (erro 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "maria@example.com",
    "password": "senhaerrada"
}

###Login com email inexistente (erro 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

###Login com email em maiusculo (sucesso 200)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "MARIA@EXAMPLE.COM",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Rota protegida sem token (erro 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/me

### Rota protegida com token qualquer (temporario: sucesso 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer qualquer-token
